    <code code="51848-0" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Evaluation note"/>
    <title>Assessment</title>
    <text><list><item>Elevated blood pressure at a pre-expedition medical assessment, 144/90 mmHg in the office without symptoms; hypertension not yet confirmed; one week of home readings requested: active, confirmed [S]</item><item>Nicotine dependence, pipe tobacco: about 25 g a week since his early twenties; first pipe within an hour of waking; has never tried to stop: active, confirmed [S]</item><item>Personal history of scurvy on a long polar sledge journey in his mid-thirties, with red gums and swollen ankles and legs, treated with fresh seal meat, and full recovery; months on preserved food again ahead: active, confirmed [S]</item></list></text>

  </section>
